@page "/"

<PageTitle>Blazor e AI</PageTitle>

<h1>Blazor e AI: UI reattive tra streaming e agenti</h1>
<p class="lead mb-4">Quattro soluzioni corrette per quattro requisiti differenti.</p>

<div class="row g-4 demo-grid">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <a class="card h-100 text-decoration-none" href="demo1">
            <div class="card-body">
                <span class="demo-number">1</span>
                <h2>Aspetto il risultato</h2>
                <p><code>Task&lt;T&gt;</code> e spinner fino alla risposta completa.</p>
            </div>
        </a>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <a class="card h-100 text-decoration-none" href="demo2">
            <div class="card-body">
                <span class="demo-number">2</span>
                <h2>Streaming con IAsyncEnumerable</h2>
                <p>Il testo arriva mentre il modello lo produce.</p>
            </div>
        </a>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <a class="card h-100 text-decoration-none" href="demo3">
            <div class="card-body">
                <span class="demo-number">3</span>
                <h2>Pipeline AI</h2>
                <p>Eventi progressivi da una pipeline Microsoft Agent Framework.</p>
            </div>
        </a>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <a class="card h-100 text-decoration-none" href="demo4">
            <div class="card-body">
                <span class="demo-number">4</span>
                <h2>Background processing con Channel&lt;T&gt;</h2>
                <p>Queue e worker disaccoppiano il lifetime dalla UI.</p>
            </div>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
